WEBVTT

00:20:55.704 --> 00:21:00.871
All around the world, in Columbus, Georgia
, in Cardiff, Wales, in Chongqing,

00:21:00.871 --> 00:21:04.329
China, in Chennai, India,
will leave their homes,

00:21:04.913 --> 00:21:08.163
they'll get in their cars or they'll
take public transportation,

00:21:08.163 --> 00:21:12.079
or they will carry themselves by foot
and they'll step into a room

00:21:12.538 --> 00:21:16.246
and sit down next to someone they don't
know or maybe someone they do.

00:21:17.704 --> 00:21:20.413
And the lights will go down
and they'll watch a movie.

00:21:21.954 --> 00:21:28.329
They watch movies about aliens or robots
or robot aliens or regular people,

00:21:28.704 --> 00:21:31.871
but they will all be movies about
what it means to be human.